FINANCE COMMITTEE
MINUTES
A meeting of the Finance Committee was held on Tuesday, June 3, 2025, in Council Chambers
and via electronic meeting, starting at 12:00 p.m. Those in attendance were as follows:
COMMITTEE MEMBERS:
Pete Laybourn, Chairman; Mark Moody: Dr. Mark Rinne; and
Scott Roybal. Absent: Ken Esquibel.
AGENDA ITEMS
6.
APPLICATIONS!LICENSES/PERMITS:
b)
Application for a restaurant liquor license filed with the City Clerk’s Office for
Cheyenne Hokkaido LLC d/h/a Cheyenne Hokkaido Ramen, 1720 Capitol Ave.,
Cheyenne, WY.
Mr. Moody moved to approve, seconded by Mr. Roybal. Motion carried by unanimous voice vote.
Kylie Soden, City Clerk, provided a staff report and committee member Roybal commented on
the item.
10.
ORDINANCE
READING
— Approving and establishing revised water and sewer
rates, tap and system development fees, administrative fees, service charges and penalties,
and septic and commercial waste dump rates, as recommended by the Board of Public
Utilities.
Mr. Royhal moved to approve on 3 and final reading, seconded by Dr. Rinne.
Motion carried
with Dr. Rinne and Mr. Roybal voting “YES” and Mr. Moody voting “NO.”
Brad Bowen, Board of Public Utilities Administrator, provided a staff report.
24.
RESOLUTIONT
— Approving the budget of the Cheyenne Regional Airport Board for the
Fiscal Year beginning July 1, 2025, and ending June 30, 2026. (SPONSOR
— DR. RINNE)
Dr. Rinnc moved to adopt, seconded by Mr. Moody. Motion carried by unanimous voice vote.
Robin Lockman, City Treasurer, provided a staff report and Jennifer Nelson, Cheyenne Reginal
Airport Director of Finance, provided additional information. Tim Bradshaw, Cheyenne Regional
Airport Director, provided information related to the discrepancy between revenues and expenses.
Chairman Layboum and committee member Roybal commented on the item.
